3442,"text":"哼，志琼你就不要到处乱跑啦！免得又像上次一样…","nextNodeIds":[710360207]},{"nodeId":710360207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":2682074578,"text":"不会的，不会的。多亏了前辈的努力，层岩巨渊已经安全了许多。地质特征也变得…唔，稳定了许多。","nextNodeIds":[710360208]},{"nodeId":710360208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":2582301338,"text":"不过瑾武姐和海迪夫还需要进一步分析那块神秘晶体的…那个…","nextNodeIds":[710360209]},{"nodeId":710360209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":1089918482,"text":"唔，波长？海迪夫是这么说的，大概又是须弥的奇怪术语吧…总之，首先需要安置信标才能取得数据。","nextNodeIds":[710360210]},{"nodeId":710360210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":3215082418,"text":"瑾武姐最近终于腾出空来把信标组装齐全了，我需要把它们安置在几个特定地点来读取读数。","nextNodeIds":[710360211]},{"nodeId":710360211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":3918944274,"text":"隔一段时间后再前去回收，回收的数据就可以留给海迪夫去运算了。","nextNodeIds":[710360212]},{"nodeId":710360212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":2963265458,"text":"之前由于很多区域都不安全，我们只能局限在营地内进行读数测算…","nextNodeIds":[710360213]},{"nodeId":710360213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":4220405682,"text":"但现在既然通路被前辈打开了，用信标进行实地测量也就能得到更准确的数据了。","nextNodeIds":[710360214]},{"nodeId":710360214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":1688903554,"text":"呼…有点事情做还是比闲着好。对了，前辈如果没有其他事情的话也请跟我一起来吧！","nextNodeIds":[710360215,710360217]},{"nodeId":710360215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":1135894602,"text":"那么，我们出发吧。","nextNodeIds":[710360216]},{"nodeId":710360216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20523,"speakerName":"志琼","textMapHash":584092090,"text":"好的，那么我们出发！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710360217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅行者","textMapHash":4209833490,"text":"有我们什么好处吗？","nextNodeIds":[710360218]},{"